Chapter: PunctualSmoke
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Positive tests for punctual functions: default instruction budget,
 explicit instruction budget, basic arithmetic in punctual context.

Section: Definitions

  punctual fast-add : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  fast-add (a) (b) = a + b

  punctual 512 bounded-mul : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  bounded-mul (a) (b) = a * b

  punctual bounded-sub : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  bounded-sub (a) (b) = a - b

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show (fast-add 10 32))
    print-line-uni (show (bounded-mul 6 7))
    print-line-uni (show (bounded-sub 100 58))
  end

